  "details": "When playing with Full Body Tracking, there is no option to have stand or sit modes in the menu, so you can't control how fast you are moving when laying down. While this can be fixed by adjusting your playspace, there could be an option in the menu to disable movement speed scaling based on your height in the playspace. This would allow for full body users, such as myself, to not rely on additional programs such as OVR Advanced Settings as much as we currently do.",
